WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.880
If you take medication for diabetes, including insulin or oral medications like Metformin,

2
00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:09.520
the day before your procedure requires some extra attention. Because you'll be on a clear

3
00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:15.280
liquid diet today, your usual medication routine may need to be adjusted to avoid low blood sugar.

4
00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:19.040
If you haven't been already instructed, please contact your doctor's office or your

5
00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:23.840
prescribing physician for specific guidance on what to take, what to hold, and when.

6
00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:27.360
Do not adjust your insulin or diabetes medications on your own.

7
00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:32.320
If you experience any symptoms of low blood sugar, like shakiness, sweating, or confusion,

8
00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:34.640
treat it promptly and contact them right away.
